The quad approach lost. I’m doing one small missing tile sweep for interleaved projection: lower row tile with wider hidden tile (`BLOCK_M=32`, `BLOCK_H=64`) was not in the previous grid and may reduce repeated input loads without the high register pressure of `128x64`.
